1
00:00:00,143 --> 00:00:01,237
Ada negara yang salah satu

2
00:00:01,257 --> 00:00:02,290
kepala negaranya adalah

3
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,552
presiden negara lain.

4
00:00:03,572 --> 00:00:04,611
Saat ini,

5
00:00:04,631 --> 00:00:06,634
presiden Prancis.

6
00:00:06,654 --> 00:00:07,377
Ini Andorra,

7
00:00:07,397 --> 00:00:09,034
negara kecil di Pegunungan

8
00:00:09,054 --> 00:00:10,922
Pyrenees, terjepit di antara

9
00:00:10,942 --> 00:00:12,499
Prancis dan Spanyol.

10
00:00:12,519 --> 00:00:14,325
Kepala negaranya ada dua,

11
00:00:14,345 --> 00:00:16,020
disebut pangeran bersama.

12
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:16,872
Yang pertama,

13
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:18,208
Uskup Urgell,

14
00:00:18,228 --> 00:00:19,462
dari kota di seberang

15
00:00:19,482 --> 00:00:20,929
perbatasan Spanyol.

16
00:00:20,949 --> 00:00:21,703
Yang kedua,

17
00:00:21,723 --> 00:00:22,693
Presiden Prancis,

18
00:00:22,713 --> 00:00:23,653
siapa pun yang sedang

19
00:00:23,673 --> 00:00:24,293
menjabat.

20
00:00:24,313 --> 00:00:26,835
Semua bermula tahun 1278.

21
00:00:26,855 --> 00:00:28,664
Uskup Urgell dan Count Foix

22
00:00:28,684 --> 00:00:29,841
berebut Andorra,

23
00:00:29,861 --> 00:00:30,862
lalu sepakat berbagi

24
00:00:30,882 --> 00:00:31,869
