25
00:00:31,889 --> 00:00:33,015
Hak Count Foix kemudian turun

26
00:00:33,035 --> 00:00:34,324
ke raja Prancis,

27
00:00:34,344 --> 00:00:35,470
dan akhirnya ke presiden

28
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:36,233
Prancis.

29
00:00:36,253 --> 00:00:37,534
Andorra baru punya konstitusi

30
00:00:37,554 --> 00:00:40,134
tertulis tahun 1993.

31
00:00:40,154 --> 00:00:41,636
Rakyatnya menyetujui lewat

32
00:00:41,656 --> 00:00:43,135
pemungutan suara,

33
00:00:43,155 --> 00:00:44,606
lalu dua pangeran bersama

34
00:00:44,626 --> 00:00:46,076
